      "trackName": "1-2 Player Cowboy Duel",
      "description": "Features: \n- One player and 2 player mode for watch, tablet and phone!\n- Authentic western feeling\n- Cute retro pixel art\n- Play offline\n- More games you can unlock inside\n\nMore info:\nYou're a cowboy and you have been challenged to a duel! \nFor what reason? Who knows...\nAnyway, you're goal is to hit the other cowboy (not the cows!). \nAfter every six shots you need to reload. \nFor every time you hit the other cowboy, you get 10 points, if you hit the wall you get one point, still. \nEach cowboy has three lives.\nBut enough now, it's time to face your rival!",
